        <object label="&lt;b&gt;DurableExecutor&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;execute() — the loop&lt;br&gt;budget+reporter per run&lt;br&gt;exits&lt;br&gt;injects store +&lt;br&gt;recoveryManager" class="component.service" id="n_exec">
